{"about_the_game":"Rocket Armor is the most realistic and exciting flying experience in VR today! It features a completely new type of flight control system and maneuvering capability \u2013 it\u2019s like really flying using two huge rockets strapped to your arms! Rocket Armor suits you up in a suit of futuristic armor and sets you on a timed course through space, hitting platform marks and maneuvering through ring structures in ever more complex patterns while fighting off alien enemies with your laser and sword weapons. You fly with true freedom of movement and a full range of motion in space \u2013 all controlled by your powerful arm-mounted rockets. Feel the thundering acceleration as you shoot upward and then plunge back to earth, or power into a sharp turn at full throttle. <br><br>You learn the skills needed to fly the Rocket Armor and qualify as an Alpha Pilot. Fight and fly to complete all the levels and be prepared for more difficult and dangerous missions in the future. This is the ultimate free flight experience in VR (and a fantastic game)! So SUIT UP Alpha Pilot and join us for the Rocket Armor ride!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734350/extras/205468b42eed6fa3d4936b433b3b4bab.poster.avif?t=1671742562\" width=374 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734350/extras/205468b42eed6fa3d4936b433b3b4bab.webm?t=1671742562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734350/extras/205468b42eed6fa3d4936b433b3b4bab.mp4?t=1671742562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/734350/extras/c9d58385975bbe8d8d338604f2a7b99c.poster.avif?t=1671742562\"