ng down on platforms over a timed course, fighting off enemies that can disrupt your flight path<br><br>\u2022  Laser and sword weapons enable fast-paced 3D combat with swarm AI enemy <br><br>\u2022  Offline leaderboard tracking allows you to see your competitive position based on your time over the course<br><br>\u2022  Original, dramatic soundtrack works to increase the pilot\u2019s sense of immersion and excitement<br><br>\u2022  Alpha Pilot certification is earned on completion of the 10 levels, qualifying the pilot for future Rocket Armor missions and adventures which are currently in development","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"94969d51ee3a31552308a3457bd6c4f486d6256c.jpg","localized_name":"Tactical Stabbing Device Discovered","name":"Tactical Stabbing Device Discovered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734350/94969d51ee3a31552308a3457bd6c4f486d6256c.jpg"},{"icon":"35b2792620a70fa910b12e22cfda38d058654c5a.jpg","localized_name":"Certified Alpha Pilot","name":"Certified Alpha Pilot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734350/35b2792620a70fa910b12e22cfda38d058654c5a.jpg"},{"icon":"74005e21332cfcafdf44f9bf72f17da185a0a7ab.jpg","localized_name":"Clutch","name":"Clutch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734350/74005e21332cfcafdf44f9bf72f17da185a0a7ab.jpg"},{"icon":"3be3b95d05395f1f4a580b574234bb726873be06.jpg","localized_name":"Just Warming Up","name":"Just Warming Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734350/3be3b95d05395f1f4a580b574234bb726873be06.jpg"},{"icon":"3be3b95d05395f1f4a580b574234bb726873be06.jpg","localized_name":"Advanced Techniques","name":"Advanced Techniques","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/734350/3be3b95d05395f1f4a580b574234bb726873be06.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgrou